/**
 * Which layouts each property offers.
 *
 * Three or four per property: fewer than three leaves a tab strip with nothing
 * to compare, and more than four starts wrapping onto a second row and stops
 * being scannable. Each set is built around the size the listing actually is,
 * with its neighbours either side — a studio building offers studios and one
 * bedrooms, not a three bedroom it does not have.
 */
